hollow-fog-title = Hollow Fog
hollow-fog-description = A fog has swallowed the station. When the siren sounds, run, hide, and listen for the static.

hollow-announcement-sender = ???
hollow-announcement-start = Visibility on the station has dropped to near zero. Sensors report a dense fog of unknown origin. If you hear a siren, find somewhere safe.
hollow-announcement-otherworld = The walls are rusting. The lights are bleeding. Something is moving in the dark.
hollow-announcement-fog-returns = The siren has stopped. The fog rolls back in, and the station is quiet again. For now.

cmd-hollowadvance-desc = Skips the Hollow Fog game mode to its next phase.
cmd-hollowadvance-help = Usage: hollowadvance
cmd-hollowadvance-advanced = Hollow Fog is now in the {$phase} phase.
cmd-hollowadvance-no-rule = Hollow Fog isn't running. Start it with the "hollow" preset or "addgamerule HollowFogRule".
